---
import { Clock, CreditCard, MapPin } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="contacto" class="py-24 bg-ice dark:bg-dark/50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-[3rem] shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-mint-100 dark:border-slate-700">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="p-10 lg:p-16">
                    <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">Cita demo</span>
                    <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mt-4 mb-6 text-dark dark:text-white">Cuéntanos qué necesitas</h2>
                    <p class="mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-soft dark:text-mint-100/50">
                        Este formulario es visual para el demo. Para vivir el flujo completo, usa el chat y simula una cita con motivo y horario preferido.
                    </p>
                    <form class="space-y-6">
                        <input type="text" placeholder="Nombre" class="w-full px-5 py-4 bg-ice dark:bg-dark rounded-2xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-mint-500 transition-all dark:text-white">
                        <input type="text" placeholder="Motivo de consulta" class="w-full px-5 py-4 bg-ice dark:bg-dark rounded-2xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-mint-500 transition-all dark:text-white">
                        <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Día u horario preferido" class="w-full px-5 py-4 bg-ice dark:bg-dark rounded-2xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-mint-500 transition-all resize-none dark:text-white"></textarea>
                        <button type="button" class="w-full bg-mint-500 text-white py-5 rounded-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs hover:bg-accent shadow-lg shadow-mint-500/20 transition-all">
                            Simular solicitud
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </div>
                <div class="relative h-full min-h-[460px] bg-mint-500 overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(255,255,255,0.35),transparent_40%),radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_left,rgba(15,23,42,0.25),transparent_35%)]"></div>
                    <div class="relative h-full p-10 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-between text-white">
                        <div>
                            <div class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white/15 border border-white/20">
                                <MapPin class="w-7 h-7" />
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="mt-8 text-3xl font-black">Zona norte de Mérida</h3>
                            <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-mint-50">
                                Referencia general: cerca de Prolongación Montejo y Altabrisa. Dentamenta no publica una dirección real exacta porque es una clínica demo.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid gap-4 mt-10">
                            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/12 border border-white/20 p-5 backdrop-blur">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <Clock class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 text-mint-100" />
                                    <div>
                                        <h4 class="font-extrabold">Horarios</h4>
                                        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-mint-50">Lun–Vie: 9:00 a.m.–2:00 p.m. y 4:00 p.m.–8:00 p.m.<br />Sáb: 9:00 a.m.–2:00 p.m. · Dom: cerrado.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/12 border border-white/20 p-5 backdrop-blur">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <CreditCard class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 text-mint-100" />
                                    <div>
                                        <h4 class="font-extrabold">Formas de pago</h4>
                                        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-mint-50">Efectivo, transferencia, tarjeta de débito o crédito. Meses sin intereses sólo en tratamientos seleccionados.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
